WEBVTT

01:30.360 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:36.880 --> 01:38.560
TEA

01:38.640 --> 01:42.080
INSIDE XILIN COUNTRY

01:42.160 --> 01:43.160
It's getting harder

01:43.240 --> 01:44.080
-and harder now.
-Grandpa.

01:44.160 --> 01:45.840
-I don't understand.
-I'm hungry.

01:45.920 --> 01:46.760
-Why did our life
-Grandpa.

01:46.840 --> 01:48.520
-become like this?
-I want to eat something.

01:49.040 --> 01:50.160
Who knows?

01:50.800 --> 01:52.280
Please give me some rice.

01:52.360 --> 01:54.240
We don't have rice. How can we have rice?

01:54.320 --> 01:57.280
Look. There's only vegetable soup
with wild vegetables.

01:57.360 --> 01:59.240
We haven't eaten for days.

01:59.320 --> 02:02.520
Now, there's a war every day,
and food is in short supply.

02:02.600 --> 02:04.160
We can't even afford to buy rice.

02:04.240 --> 02:07.880
If it wasn't for those divine edicts,
how could all this have happened?

02:07.960 --> 02:09.360
That's right.

02:09.440 --> 02:13.120
I heard that Nanyuan is in trouble
because of the divine edict.

02:13.200 --> 02:15.680
But that's the business
of the rich and powerful,

02:15.760 --> 02:18.240
-Divine edict again.
-so let's not discuss it.

02:19.760 --> 02:20.600
EVERLIFE HALL

02:20.680 --> 02:21.560
Your Excellency.

02:22.080 --> 02:23.760
According to the divine edict…

02:23.840 --> 02:24.600
XILIN'S PALACE

02:24.680 --> 02:27.680
…there is an abundance of fairy grass
on Spirit Mountain in the Nanyuan tribe.

02:28.280 --> 02:33.200
Will that really help me make the elixir
that will give me eternal life?

02:33.280 --> 02:37.000
The divine edict gives you
the secret, and it is fleeting.

02:37.600 --> 02:40.600
If you are ungrateful
and disobey divine edict…

02:40.680 --> 02:42.480
I dare not. I dare not.

02:43.000 --> 02:44.080
But…

02:44.160 --> 02:47.600
I've already sent troops
to attack other tribes for the gold mine,

02:48.200 --> 02:51.080
so I'm afraid I'll be short of troops

02:51.600 --> 02:52.760
if I attack Nanyuan again.

02:54.040 --> 02:56.680
Since you don't value
your chance at immortality,

02:57.200 --> 02:58.880
let it be with others.

02:58.960 --> 03:01.080
No, no, no. Please don't be angry.

03:01.160 --> 03:04.440
I'll recruit soldiers and take back
Nanyuan's spirit medicines.

03:04.520 --> 03:05.560
If I can't,

03:05.640 --> 03:07.080
I'll marry my useless daughter, Qingyang,

03:07.160 --> 03:08.920
to the king of another small country
in exchange for troops.

03:09.000 --> 03:10.000
The process is not important.

03:10.080 --> 03:11.600
You only need results.

03:12.200 --> 03:13.480
I will follow the divine edict.

03:19.240 --> 03:22.080
Your Majesty. Princess Qingyang
has been waiting outside.

03:22.160 --> 03:23.240
Send her in.

03:23.320 --> 03:24.160
Yes.

03:28.160 --> 03:29.120
Father.

03:29.200 --> 03:32.160
My mother has been ill for a long time
and is in dire need of reishi.

03:35.640 --> 03:37.920
Reishi is to be used for alchemy.

03:38.600 --> 03:40.680
A sick woman like her doesn't deserve it.

03:41.880 --> 03:44.800
Don't worry. Leave me alone. Go away.

03:51.440 --> 03:52.720
Who is it?

04:32.040 --> 04:32.880
Yan.

04:32.960 --> 04:35.520
Thanks for running around.

04:36.400 --> 04:37.760
It was the right thing to do.

04:38.760 --> 04:41.520
My investigation revealed
that Your Majesty was right.

04:41.600 --> 04:44.080
There are people behind the scenes
manipulating those countries.

04:44.160 --> 04:46.160
It's the divine edict
that's causing the furor.

04:50.400 --> 04:52.880
The Divine Clan is using
those nations to pressure me.

04:53.400 --> 04:55.240
They're not worthy of the gods
when they start wars

04:55.320 --> 04:57.120
and take the lives of many nations
for their own gain.

04:57.760 --> 04:59.000
Now that you have
ascertained the situation,

05:00.280 --> 05:03.280
send Dongze's ambassadors
to each country to deter them

05:03.360 --> 05:05.680
and send reinforcements
to protect the vulnerable tribes.

05:07.920 --> 05:09.920
If there are any more collaborators
with the Divine Clan,

05:10.000 --> 05:12.800
-they will not be tolerated.
-Yes, sir.

05:25.480 --> 05:27.960
Now that war is raging in every country,

05:28.920 --> 05:31.200
Zhao Ming still
has no intention of giving in.

05:31.840 --> 05:34.120
The divine child is still unclear,
but Zhao Ming becomes another problem.

05:34.760 --> 05:38.920
In a lowly place like the human realm,
there is indeed a lot of trouble.

05:40.080 --> 05:40.960
Since coercion doesn't work,

05:42.400 --> 05:43.240
what about enticement?

05:45.640 --> 05:46.480
Immortal.

05:47.080 --> 05:49.160
Immortal. Immortal.

05:49.240 --> 05:52.960
Sir. An immortal
has descended upon the palace.

05:54.280 --> 05:58.000
The divine envoy brings divine decree
and wants to ordain His Majesty.

05:58.080 --> 06:01.040
The Humans will have an immortal.

06:03.320 --> 06:04.480
The divine decree

06:06.120 --> 06:08.280
is a useless order.

06:15.000 --> 06:17.200
Your Majesty, think twice.

06:17.280 --> 06:18.680
The Divine Clan honors you,

06:19.320 --> 06:23.480
so as long as you sacrifice 3,000 children
according to the divine edict,

06:23.560 --> 06:25.120
you will become immortal.

06:25.800 --> 06:29.080
Faced with such a great honor,
aren't you going to accept the order?

06:57.560 --> 06:59.680
How dare you destroy the divine edict?

06:59.760 --> 07:00.720
I have already said

07:01.600 --> 07:05.320
Dongze does not accept the divine edict,
and I have no intention of becoming a god.

07:06.680 --> 07:08.400
You're so ungrateful.

07:09.000 --> 07:12.400
You are at war, and more
than 3,000 people have died.

07:12.480 --> 07:15.080
We are only asking you
to sacrifice 3,000 children.

07:15.160 --> 07:18.960
Are they more important
than those who died in the war?

07:19.040 --> 07:20.320
The Divine Clan

07:21.560 --> 07:23.840
doesn't understand the meaning of life.

07:26.240 --> 07:27.080
Zhao Ming.

07:27.840 --> 07:30.960
Don't waste my mercy.

07:31.040 --> 07:32.480
Pass on my order.

07:33.200 --> 07:34.440
From this day forward,

07:35.080 --> 07:36.640
kill every member of the Divine Clan

07:37.440 --> 07:39.080
-who comes to Dongze.
-Yes, sir.

07:39.160 --> 07:40.000
Who dares?

07:46.640 --> 07:50.080
You are bent
on disrespecting the Divine Clan.

07:50.160 --> 07:53.440
Zhao Ming, you will pay.

07:54.840 --> 07:56.080
I didn't realize
there were people in this world

07:56.160 --> 07:57.160
who didn't care about becoming immortal.

07:58.760 --> 08:01.960
This tough guy makes things complicated

08:02.040 --> 08:03.200
and interesting.

08:04.120 --> 08:06.120
Since our warnings don't work,

08:06.960 --> 08:08.440
we can ask someone else
to make things difficult for him.

08:08.520 --> 08:11.440
The Divine Clan is confined
in the human realm and can't kill him,

08:11.520 --> 08:13.040
but if

08:13.560 --> 08:14.680
the nations he protects

08:15.360 --> 08:17.680
rise up and turn on him,

08:18.480 --> 08:20.160
it'll be a much better show,

08:20.760 --> 08:21.840
won't it?

08:24.520 --> 08:28.920
Turning the countries that Zhao Ming
cares about into our weapons

08:29.440 --> 08:30.560
and making them attack Zhao Ming

08:32.080 --> 08:33.960
is a good idea,

08:34.480 --> 08:38.080
but during the war,

08:38.159 --> 08:39.960
Zhao Ming has already sent its envoys

08:40.559 --> 08:44.560
to calm down the wars
with the stick and the carrot,

08:45.280 --> 08:48.920
so I am afraid
it will not be easy to make them

08:49.000 --> 08:50.080
declare war on Zhao Ming now.

08:51.080 --> 08:52.800
People are extremely stupid and greedy.

08:53.400 --> 08:55.600
The Lord of Xilin longs for eternal life,

08:56.200 --> 08:59.080
so if we throw him
this temptation of being immortal,

08:59.160 --> 09:00.560
all we need to do

09:02.400 --> 09:03.280
is to incite it

09:04.440 --> 09:05.680
to boost the war.

09:07.600 --> 09:09.600
My favorite thing is war.

09:10.280 --> 09:13.280
This world is meant to be filled

09:14.520 --> 09:15.920
with war.

09:17.240 --> 09:18.760
Your Majesty, do not worry too much.

09:19.360 --> 09:21.800
The nations turned against us,

09:22.520 --> 09:25.720
but our border guards
are well-trained and strong,

09:25.800 --> 09:26.840
so they will be able
to overwhelm the enemy.

09:27.480 --> 09:29.600
The Humans should have been a family,

09:30.120 --> 09:32.520
but now, they have to fight
and kill on the battlefield.

09:32.600 --> 09:35.000
The Divine Clan's plan
was extremely vicious.

09:36.160 --> 09:37.240
Moreover,

09:37.760 --> 09:39.360
the current war situation is strange,

09:39.440 --> 09:41.280
and the tactics of the countries
are tricky and changeable,

09:41.800 --> 09:44.440
so it must be the Divine Clan's
manipulation behind the scenes

09:44.520 --> 09:46.360
that caused the war to continue.

09:47.400 --> 09:48.240
Your Majesty.

09:53.600 --> 09:56.560
The spy's pigeon has sent word that
the lord of Xilin has killed our envoy.

09:57.200 --> 09:59.400
He has gathered the armies
of the nations and tribes

09:59.480 --> 10:01.440
into a powerful alliance

10:01.520 --> 10:03.400
and is heading for the borders of Dongze.

10:09.360 --> 10:12.560
This battle is the result
of internal strife,

10:12.640 --> 10:15.520
and the Divine Clan is stirring up
and planning the war.

10:15.600 --> 10:17.800
The will of the nation's warriors
is not strong enough,

10:18.400 --> 10:20.560
so if we only send Dongze's strongest army
to meet the enemy,

10:21.240 --> 10:23.280
no matter how strong Dongze's army is,

10:23.800 --> 10:25.440
it may not be enough to quell this.

10:26.880 --> 10:30.440
Inform all the generals
to be ready to march at a moment's notice.

10:30.520 --> 10:31.440
-Yes.
-Yes.

10:52.600 --> 10:53.600
Zhao Ming.

10:55.080 --> 10:57.480
Pearl, why are you here?

10:57.560 --> 11:00.480
I have a bad appetite when I'm alone,

11:01.680 --> 11:03.640
so I want you to eat with me.

11:04.240 --> 11:06.040
Do you want me to eat with you,

11:06.720 --> 11:08.240
or do you want to keep me company?

11:10.080 --> 11:12.840
I really can't hide anything from you.

11:13.440 --> 11:15.400
There's still a lot of truth
I haven't learned,

11:15.480 --> 11:18.360
but I know people can't carry on

11:18.440 --> 11:19.920
if they don't eat properly.

11:20.000 --> 11:23.360
What will happen to those who need you
if your health collapses?

11:24.040 --> 11:26.920
So, the only way to have the energy
to think about the battle

11:27.000 --> 11:28.800
is if you can eat well.

11:29.480 --> 11:30.320
You're right.

11:32.400 --> 11:33.480
Pearl.

11:34.360 --> 11:35.960
The war is urgent right now,

11:36.760 --> 11:38.080
so I recently had
to participate in the war myself.

11:39.000 --> 11:40.280
Participate in the war?

11:41.240 --> 11:43.920
I once heard that
a king participating in a war

11:44.680 --> 11:46.760
is different from a general doing that.

11:47.720 --> 11:49.800
Do you have to go?

12:00.080 --> 12:03.960
Battles are about tactics and mindset.

12:04.040 --> 12:05.040
This time,

12:05.560 --> 12:08.520
we will not only fight against humans
but also against immortals.

12:09.080 --> 12:12.240
I must go and must win.

12:12.320 --> 12:14.880
GRACEFUL PALACE

12:17.560 --> 12:18.840
This time,

12:18.920 --> 12:21.960
we will not only fight against humans
but also against immortals.

12:22.520 --> 12:25.720
I must go and must win.

12:26.760 --> 12:28.360
Why am I upset?

12:28.960 --> 12:30.240
Is it because I'm worried

12:30.800 --> 12:33.680
or upset?

13:05.200 --> 13:06.680
I want to know

13:07.280 --> 13:08.880
what feelings are.

13:09.800 --> 13:12.200
Are feelings lust or motivation?

13:12.840 --> 13:14.640
As long as I keep missing him,

13:15.160 --> 13:16.760
we'll never be apart.

13:18.040 --> 13:19.440
No matter what happens,

13:20.320 --> 13:22.440
I will always be with Zhao Ming.

13:46.680 --> 13:48.160
Please forgive the Chaos Pearl.

13:48.240 --> 13:50.880
Now, she has not yet awakened,
so she has feelings.

13:50.960 --> 13:53.280
I will bring her back
to the Celestial Altar as soon as possible

13:53.360 --> 13:55.120
and avoid the divine artifact
having feelings.

13:55.200 --> 13:57.720
This thunder is only a warning.

13:57.800 --> 14:00.440
If she continues to have feelings,
celestial punishment will go to her.

14:01.160 --> 14:03.680
The rules cannot be broken.

14:03.760 --> 14:06.560
If you cannot stop
the Chaos Pearl from having feelings,

14:06.640 --> 14:09.000
I will destroy her.

14:09.520 --> 14:12.680
Since the dawn of creation,
you have been indifferent to all things,

14:12.760 --> 14:14.720
but today, you are impulsive.

14:14.800 --> 14:17.480
Is this because you love her?

14:21.360 --> 14:22.200
I do not.

14:22.880 --> 14:25.760
GRACEFUL PALACE

14:38.800 --> 14:39.800
You're finally awake.

14:40.880 --> 14:41.880
Zhao Ming.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.920
You're about to participate in the war,

14:51.000 --> 14:52.760
so don't waste your spiritual power on me.

14:54.160 --> 14:57.240
You've been struck by lightning,
and your body is depleted,

14:58.920 --> 15:01.160
so the doctor's medicine
for gathering energy may not work.

15:01.920 --> 15:03.400
Giving you my spiritual power
is the safest way.

15:13.640 --> 15:15.160
Who says the doctor's medicine is useless?

15:16.240 --> 15:17.360
I feel much better now.

15:18.000 --> 15:20.240
Besides, I wasn't struck by lightning.

15:20.840 --> 15:22.400
My teacher blocked that for me.

15:23.440 --> 15:25.600
They say only bad people
get struck by lightning,

15:25.680 --> 15:26.720
so I'm fine now.

15:35.120 --> 15:37.000
But that thunder was very strange,

15:37.920 --> 15:40.520
so I sent someone to investigate what
caused the thunder at Graceful Palace.

15:41.200 --> 15:42.120
Pearl.

15:42.640 --> 15:45.640
In the future, if the sky is different,
try not to go out.

15:46.400 --> 15:48.040
You must be more careful

15:48.720 --> 15:49.960
during the time I'm in the war.

15:53.520 --> 15:54.520
If you're not sure,

15:56.360 --> 15:57.840
let me go with you.

16:06.160 --> 16:07.200
Pearl.

16:08.120 --> 16:10.160
Sometimes guarding doesn't mean you need

16:10.240 --> 16:11.880
to stand in front of me
or walk alongside me.

16:13.120 --> 16:15.280
Did you know that frontline fighters

16:16.160 --> 16:17.600
are motivated by the people
they love behind them?

16:19.880 --> 16:22.000
As long as their loved ones
are safe and sound,

16:22.680 --> 16:24.440
the fighters will be able to fully commit

16:25.440 --> 16:27.480
to fighting the enemy to the end.

16:31.560 --> 16:34.080
It may seem like the fighters are guarding
their friends and family,

16:34.840 --> 16:35.920
but in fact,

16:37.080 --> 16:38.960
their friends and family
are also guarding the fighters.

16:40.440 --> 16:43.120
I want you to stay in the palace

16:44.200 --> 16:45.600
and guard me.

16:48.880 --> 16:50.040
I guard you?

16:52.600 --> 16:54.200
And how long will it take you

16:55.160 --> 16:56.800
to come back after you leave?

17:03.640 --> 17:07.119
I will return safely
before you finish this bag of candy.

17:07.960 --> 17:10.680
I will ask Yan to stay in the palace.
You can ask him anything.

17:20.319 --> 17:21.359
Zhao Ming.

17:21.960 --> 17:24.920
Starting tomorrow,
I'm going to learn swordsmanship.

17:25.960 --> 17:26.839
Swordsmanship?

17:29.200 --> 17:32.880
I don't want to be the Pearl who faints

17:32.960 --> 17:37.200
at a single thunderbolt or turns to Yan
for help with everything.

17:38.240 --> 17:39.640
Since I've decided to protect you,

17:40.560 --> 17:41.920
I must have the strength to do so.

17:44.800 --> 17:47.840
You're not the same as when you woke up.

17:48.720 --> 17:50.000
People grow up.

17:50.520 --> 17:54.240
A pearl won't grow up,
but it'll understand a lot of things.

17:55.000 --> 17:55.960
Zhao Ming.

17:56.840 --> 18:00.480
Your back will be safe and sound.

18:16.160 --> 18:19.560
TWO MONTHS LATER

18:20.120 --> 18:25.160
MING

18:42.480 --> 18:43.920
Zhao Ming has been gone
for more than two months,

18:44.000 --> 18:45.960
so are you going to stay like this?

18:46.040 --> 18:48.040
When Zhao Ming was here before,

18:48.560 --> 18:50.840
I felt like the day went by so fast,

18:52.120 --> 18:55.160
but why is every day so long now

18:55.760 --> 18:58.840
that it doesn't end after I've read

18:58.920 --> 19:00.640
so many novels,

19:00.720 --> 19:02.240
eaten so many snacks,

19:02.760 --> 19:04.400
and written so many words?

19:10.680 --> 19:12.720
That would be the idiom you taught me,

19:14.200 --> 19:15.160
days are like years, right?

19:18.040 --> 19:19.400
You've run out of candy,

19:21.480 --> 19:22.520
but he still hasn't come back.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.480
I haven't.

19:28.040 --> 19:29.200
There's one left.

19:29.880 --> 19:31.640
It was the only one left half a month ago.

19:31.720 --> 19:35.040
You dare not eat it
because you're afraid he won't come back.

19:40.480 --> 19:41.840
He will.

19:45.680 --> 19:47.000
I gave you this jade pen

19:47.600 --> 19:49.640
so that you could write
your own life instead

19:49.720 --> 19:53.120
of trusting it to others as you do now.

19:54.600 --> 19:56.000
Sir.

19:56.080 --> 19:58.000
What do you mean?

20:01.280 --> 20:02.880
Come with me to a place.

20:04.360 --> 20:07.560
After you get there,
you will know everything.

20:27.960 --> 20:29.400
This is…

20:32.080 --> 20:34.000
Zhao Ming's secret room.

20:52.080 --> 20:53.720
CHAOS PEARL

20:56.360 --> 20:58.200
Do you really know Zhao Ming?

21:01.080 --> 21:02.920
Zhao Ming is dedicated
to fighting the Divine Clan

21:03.000 --> 21:05.040
for the sake of his people.

21:05.600 --> 21:07.520
That's what you and I
have known for a long time.

21:07.600 --> 21:08.840
Yes.

21:08.920 --> 21:11.320
Fighting the Divine Clan is true,

21:11.400 --> 21:14.920
but what if it's at the cost
of using and sacrificing others?

21:16.240 --> 21:18.440
Even if Zhao Ming
was born with divine channels,

21:18.520 --> 21:19.560
the Humans are still vulnerable

21:20.440 --> 21:22.280
to the gods,

21:22.360 --> 21:23.840
so the only way he can fight them

21:24.440 --> 21:26.040
is with the power of the divine artifact.

21:28.880 --> 21:30.120
The Chaos Pearl

21:30.640 --> 21:34.680
is the tool he has at his fingertips,

21:36.240 --> 21:37.240
and you

21:40.680 --> 21:42.000
are the Chaos Pearl.

21:50.400 --> 21:52.160
Do you want to know the whole story?

21:58.880 --> 22:02.680
THE NOTE OF CHAOS

22:10.240 --> 22:11.720
When the world was first created,

22:12.520 --> 22:14.520
Hao Tian invented two divine artifacts,

22:17.160 --> 22:18.120
the Chaos Pearl

22:20.000 --> 22:21.680
and the Book of Fate,

22:32.920 --> 22:33.800
so,

22:34.320 --> 22:36.280
Zhao Ming revived you

22:37.160 --> 22:40.480
only to utilize your Chaos Power
to kill the immortals.

22:42.240 --> 22:44.080
The so-called salvation

22:44.800 --> 22:47.240
is just another way to sacrifice you.

22:48.320 --> 22:51.720
But I don't remember any of what you said.

22:53.400 --> 22:55.760
I only know that it was Zhao Ming
who awakened me

22:56.360 --> 22:58.520
and brought me much warmth and joy.

22:59.480 --> 23:03.000
I don't know the Chaos Power
or the ancient artifact.

23:03.080 --> 23:06.120
Now, I am just a wasted pearl
with no divine power.

23:06.720 --> 23:09.480
I just want to be a human
and stay by Zhao Ming's side.

23:10.480 --> 23:13.160
-Nothing else matters.
-Not even your own life?

23:16.200 --> 23:18.760
You already have feelings for Zhao Ming,

23:18.840 --> 23:21.360
so that lightning strike was a warning.

23:21.440 --> 23:24.320
Divine artifacts cannot have feelings
or fall in love with someone.

23:24.920 --> 23:27.120
Otherwise, you will be destroyed.

23:34.000 --> 23:35.520
What I can do now

23:36.880 --> 23:38.880
is take you back to the Celestial Altar

23:40.240 --> 23:41.600
and kill your love to help you continue

23:42.320 --> 23:44.400
to be a divine artifact
that will live as long as heaven.

23:45.000 --> 23:49.040
Only then will you be able
to escape this disaster.

23:51.840 --> 23:53.040
I'm not going back.

23:54.360 --> 23:56.720
I've begun to feel
what it means to have feelings,

23:57.320 --> 23:59.960
so how could I go back
to that cold and lonely life?

24:00.760 --> 24:02.880
What's the point
of living as long as heaven?

24:02.960 --> 24:05.080
What everyone cares about is different.

24:05.600 --> 24:06.760
For me,

24:07.640 --> 24:08.800
it doesn't matter how long I live.

24:09.760 --> 24:10.960
It's how I live

24:11.720 --> 24:13.840
and who I live with that matters.

24:17.160 --> 24:18.280
The Chaos Pearl you mentioned

24:19.560 --> 24:21.600
was already gone when the sky was mended.

24:22.720 --> 24:24.080
The one saved by Zhao Ming

24:25.240 --> 24:26.400
is Pearl.

24:30.760 --> 24:32.880
You and I can live forever

24:35.040 --> 24:37.480
and see through karma,

24:40.440 --> 24:42.640
but why don't you understand

24:43.920 --> 24:45.240
that human love

24:46.000 --> 24:47.680
is the most fleeting

24:48.600 --> 24:50.360
and fragile of all?

24:52.440 --> 24:55.840
Is it really me
who doesn't understand love?

25:03.480 --> 25:04.320
Fate.

25:06.480 --> 25:09.080
I should call you that, right?

25:10.720 --> 25:13.360
You said we were together
for tens of thousands of years,

25:14.000 --> 25:15.120
but I'm sorry,

25:16.360 --> 25:18.120
I don't have that memory today.

25:21.000 --> 25:23.040
Maybe it saddens you to say this,

25:24.400 --> 25:26.000
but I'm not going back with you.

25:26.080 --> 25:27.840
I'm going to stay here

25:29.880 --> 25:31.360
and wait for Zhao Ming to return.

25:46.480 --> 25:48.120
Even if you're going to die,

25:50.080 --> 25:52.280
will you stay with him?

26:14.840 --> 26:16.160
Sure enough.

26:16.240 --> 26:18.640
I can't forcefully
take the divine artifact away.

26:21.480 --> 26:22.520
What are you going to do?

26:26.360 --> 26:27.720
In that case,

26:29.800 --> 26:31.800
make three bets with me.

26:31.880 --> 26:35.760
If I win,
follow me back to the Celestial Altar,

26:35.840 --> 26:37.160
and if you win,

26:40.600 --> 26:43.960
you can stay and remain a human.

26:45.080 --> 26:46.360
Why should I bet with you?

26:47.120 --> 26:48.160
Because

26:49.160 --> 26:51.880
I can give you this Qiankun Pearl,

26:51.960 --> 26:55.240
which can save Zhao Ming's life
at a critical moment.

26:57.000 --> 26:58.160
What do you mean?

26:59.760 --> 27:03.280
Fate told me Zhao Ming would be
in a life-and-death situation.

27:04.120 --> 27:06.040
The Book of Fate has never been wrong,

27:06.120 --> 27:09.400
and Qiankun Pearl can reverse everything

27:09.480 --> 27:12.000
and give Zhao Ming a chance to live,

27:12.760 --> 27:13.880
so you have

27:15.280 --> 27:16.400
to bet with me.

27:22.240 --> 27:23.080
OK.

27:24.880 --> 27:25.960
I will.

27:49.280 --> 27:50.320
Some destinies

27:53.240 --> 27:55.080
can't be ignored

27:56.440 --> 27:58.320
just because you want them to be.

28:20.320 --> 28:22.960
What exactly do you think feelings are?

28:23.040 --> 28:27.200
Why is it that human beings are alive
and well when they have feelings?

28:27.280 --> 28:29.400
If we had feelings,

28:29.480 --> 28:31.800
wouldn't the Celestial Altar be so cold?

28:31.880 --> 28:34.760
You and I are divine artifacts
that are and deserve to follow Hao Tian.

28:34.840 --> 28:37.200
The exploration of feelings is tantamount
to the process of extinction.

28:37.280 --> 28:38.960
Anyway, I have you by my side.

28:39.040 --> 28:40.600
No matter how the sun and moon change,

28:40.680 --> 28:42.120
no matter if this is
the universe or the foreworld,

28:42.200 --> 28:43.640
Fate,

28:43.720 --> 28:45.320
we'll always be together.

28:45.400 --> 28:48.360
The Divine Clan's civil war
has caused the skies to break apart

28:48.440 --> 28:50.480
and everything to come to an end.

28:50.560 --> 28:53.440
The Chaos Pearl, mend the skies now.

28:53.520 --> 28:56.960
Take it upon yourself to enforce the law
to restore order to the world.

29:09.680 --> 29:13.080
GRACEFUL PALACE

29:14.040 --> 29:17.840
The gaping hole in the sky is so great
that this repair will be dangerous.

29:17.920 --> 29:18.880
Hao Tian.

29:18.960 --> 29:20.600
I would like to take
the place of the Chaos Pearl

29:20.680 --> 29:23.400
and repair the rift in the sky myself.
Please allow me to do so.

29:23.480 --> 29:25.680
The divine artifacts
have their own roles to play,

29:25.760 --> 29:27.200
and we must not disrupt their order.

29:27.280 --> 29:29.080
The Chaos Pearl specializes in salvation,

29:29.680 --> 29:31.680
so it is her duty
to deal with the catastrophe.

29:31.760 --> 29:36.240
You specialize in running,
so you have your own mission.

29:40.040 --> 29:42.440
Fate. You have defied the will of Heaven.

29:43.080 --> 29:44.840
Do you know the consequences?

31:01.480 --> 31:04.760
We can only be together if we don't die.

31:07.280 --> 31:08.360
Pearl.

31:09.560 --> 31:10.400
Be alive.

31:17.440 --> 31:20.480
Those are my memories.

31:27.800 --> 31:30.160
I must be under
the influence of Qiankun Pearl

31:30.240 --> 31:32.560
to dream those terrible things.

31:34.280 --> 31:35.720
Fate told me

31:37.000 --> 31:38.920
Zhao Ming would be
in a life-and-death situation.

31:39.560 --> 31:41.880
The Book of Fate has never been wrong,

31:43.720 --> 31:47.640
and Qiankun Pearl can reverse everything

31:48.720 --> 31:51.040
and give Zhao Ming a chance to live,

31:52.040 --> 31:53.360
so you have

31:55.400 --> 31:56.560
to bet with me.

32:04.800 --> 32:08.040
News has come from the front
that our troops have been ambushed,

32:08.640 --> 32:10.200
and His Majesty
has been seriously wounded.

32:10.720 --> 32:12.400
I'm afraid the army doctors
can't cure him.

32:12.480 --> 32:15.200
Send the best doctors to the camp now.

32:15.280 --> 32:16.200
-So,
-Yes.

32:16.280 --> 32:17.520
this is his life-and-death situation.

32:17.600 --> 32:18.840
Yan.

32:21.480 --> 32:23.120
Let me go to the barracks with the doctor.

32:23.720 --> 32:25.080
You're going there?

32:25.760 --> 32:28.040
Can you heal the injured
or kill the enemy?

32:29.440 --> 32:32.280
His Majesty's wounds
will be healed by the doctor.

32:32.920 --> 32:35.360
Zhao Ming's calamity
cannot be solved by a doctor.

32:36.560 --> 32:38.280
Take me with you. I can help him.

32:38.360 --> 32:41.600
Your presence in the palace
will be the best help to His Majesty.

32:43.760 --> 32:45.920
Zhao Ming is in danger,
and only I can save him.

32:46.000 --> 32:48.120
His Majesty's orders to me

32:48.200 --> 32:49.720
are to keep you in the palace
and protect you.

32:49.800 --> 32:51.360
You can do whatever
you want in the palace,

32:51.440 --> 32:52.680
but I won't let you leave.

32:54.000 --> 32:55.480
His Majesty's orders?

32:56.400 --> 32:58.640
Do you really only see him as a monarch?

32:59.520 --> 33:02.400
You and Zhao Ming have shared
a common bond and fought to the death.

33:03.000 --> 33:05.720
Your bond has long exceeded
that of monarch and subject

33:05.800 --> 33:07.640
and is more like that of close friends
and even brothers.

33:08.520 --> 33:11.240
I know you can't disobey a king's order,

33:12.040 --> 33:13.960
but putting aside his status as emperor,

33:14.640 --> 33:16.120
do you still have to follow the rules

33:16.200 --> 33:18.960
and do nothing when you know
your brother is in danger?

33:20.320 --> 33:22.760
Now, Zhao Ming is gravely wounded

33:23.280 --> 33:24.440
and in danger.

33:25.160 --> 33:26.120
Yan.

33:27.440 --> 33:29.800
If you are loyal,
I will not make it difficult for you,

33:30.880 --> 33:32.800
but I will go to the barracks
in my own way

33:33.320 --> 33:34.920
and see Zhao Ming.

33:58.440 --> 34:00.400
He Zhou. Where is Zhao Ming?

34:00.480 --> 34:02.960
Pearl. Why have you come?

34:03.040 --> 34:04.880
Tell me. Where is Zhao Ming?

34:09.719 --> 34:10.800
Pearl.

34:41.719 --> 34:42.560
Pearl.

34:43.080 --> 34:43.920
Why have you come?

34:48.840 --> 34:51.080
You scared me. I thought you…

34:52.120 --> 34:53.080
Thought what?

34:54.120 --> 34:55.480
Where are you hurt?

34:55.560 --> 34:57.760
Why did you lose the battle?
Why don't you retreat?

34:58.760 --> 34:59.960
We won.

35:00.960 --> 35:02.000
Won?

35:02.920 --> 35:05.960
But we received word that you lost

35:06.960 --> 35:08.120
and that you were seriously wounded.

35:08.200 --> 35:09.240
That was yesterday's news.

35:09.320 --> 35:12.520
The so-called loss was
His Majesty's way of confusing the enemy.

35:12.600 --> 35:15.960
We hid it from you
only to perfect the plan.

35:16.040 --> 35:18.440
This morning, His Majesty led his army
through the enemy camp

35:18.520 --> 35:19.480
and won a great victory.

35:21.520 --> 35:23.600
Then, why were you acting
like you were defeated?

35:24.200 --> 35:26.040
I was just agonizing
over what to have for lunch.

35:26.640 --> 35:27.760
I've been with the army for months,
and now that we've won,

35:27.840 --> 35:29.800
shouldn't we have a feast to celebrate?

35:30.960 --> 35:31.960
Do you know this too?

35:32.600 --> 35:33.440
Yes, I do.

35:36.080 --> 35:37.480
So, you kept it from me?

35:40.120 --> 35:42.960
Confuse the enemy?
You really scared me to death.

35:44.400 --> 35:45.240
What's wrong with you?

35:47.280 --> 35:48.360
I'm fine.

35:48.440 --> 35:49.800
The news is not all false.

35:50.640 --> 35:52.360
His Majesty is really wounded.

35:53.280 --> 35:54.680
Where are you hurt?

35:54.760 --> 35:56.080
Is it bad?

35:57.160 --> 35:59.920
I've brought a lot of good medicine
from the palace.

36:00.000 --> 36:01.880
Come with me,
and I'll give you some medicine.

36:20.520 --> 36:24.720
JINGYANG, PRINCESS OF XILIN

36:30.640 --> 36:32.560
Since you have fallen in love
with Zhao Ming

36:33.320 --> 36:35.200
and thus defied Hao Tian,

36:35.720 --> 36:37.960
let's make the first wager.

36:38.480 --> 36:40.480
Human nature will not be firm.

36:41.320 --> 36:42.560
Zhao Ming will fall in love
with someone else.

36:43.960 --> 36:44.880
This is…

36:45.920 --> 36:47.640
This is Princess Qingyang from Xilin.

36:48.560 --> 36:49.920
This is Pearl.

37:56.280 --> 37:59.120
Does every wound you have hurt?

38:00.920 --> 38:02.320
I grew up

38:02.400 --> 38:05.800
either following my father on campaigns
or leading troops alone.

38:06.400 --> 38:09.200
I've fought in many battles,

38:09.800 --> 38:11.400
so injuries are common.

38:11.920 --> 38:13.280
It doesn't matter.

38:18.640 --> 38:21.800
When you're unhappy, eat a candy.

38:23.720 --> 38:26.720
With sweetness,
you won't be in so much pain.

38:28.680 --> 38:32.040
You eat candy slower than I thought.

38:41.200 --> 38:43.360
I promised you my return date
with this packet of candy

38:45.440 --> 38:47.520
to give you something to look forward to,

38:48.040 --> 38:49.440
but I didn't expect you

38:50.400 --> 38:54.000
to really finish it as promised
on the day of my triumph.

38:56.560 --> 38:59.800
I was worried that if I ate it too fast,
you wouldn't be able to come back in time

39:01.200 --> 39:02.480
and that you wouldn't be able

39:04.480 --> 39:06.520
to come back after I

39:07.320 --> 39:08.720
finished the candy,

39:11.400 --> 39:14.480
so I didn't dare to continue eating it

39:16.080 --> 39:17.520
when there was only the last one left.

39:19.760 --> 39:20.840
It's a good thing

39:21.920 --> 39:24.240
that I am finally reunited with you.

39:40.360 --> 39:42.560
The armor is so heavy.

39:46.440 --> 39:47.600
You know what?

39:48.160 --> 39:50.440
There have been many rumors
about you in the palace.

39:51.120 --> 39:55.120
They all say
that you are an invincible fighter,

39:57.200 --> 39:58.760
but until today, I didn't realize

39:59.840 --> 40:01.640
that an invincible fighter

40:02.480 --> 40:03.800
carries something so heavy.

40:08.280 --> 40:10.120
I've never been that invincible.

40:10.640 --> 40:13.880
I just held the determination
of certain death every time…

40:15.600 --> 40:16.960
You must not die.

40:19.120 --> 40:20.040
Of course not.

40:23.600 --> 40:24.440
You won't.

40:32.720 --> 40:33.560
How did you get hurt?

40:34.160 --> 40:35.760
I was rubbed by the reins on my horse.

40:36.440 --> 40:38.560
-Don't worry about it. It doesn't hurt.
-Did I ever tell you

40:40.200 --> 40:41.600
you're never very good at lying?

40:43.520 --> 40:45.440
Your eyes don't lie.

40:55.200 --> 40:56.560
How can a wound this deep

40:58.080 --> 40:59.240
not hurt?

41:07.480 --> 41:08.520
Pearl.

41:10.000 --> 41:10.880
You've had

41:12.760 --> 41:13.960
a hard journey.

41:18.880 --> 41:19.960
Promise me

41:22.240 --> 41:23.440
you'll be well.

41:34.160 --> 41:36.480
You already have feelings for Zhao Ming,

41:37.080 --> 41:39.320
so, that lightning strike was a warning.

41:40.920 --> 41:44.280
Divine artifacts cannot have feelings
or fall in love with someone.

41:44.840 --> 41:47.360
Otherwise, you will be destroyed.

42:12.840 --> 42:13.920
What are you looking at?

42:15.920 --> 42:17.440
Princess Qingyang

42:17.960 --> 42:20.920
is a gift from the defeated Xilin
to His Majesty.

42:23.440 --> 42:26.840
Would even a noble princess be a gift?

42:27.920 --> 42:31.360
What's so noble about a princess
in a world of chaos?
